From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The Playport authors <dev@playport.dev>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 01:25:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] user32: log each message box's caption and text

A game that cannot start often says why in a message box and then
exits. On the phone nobody may be looking, and the runs the workstation
drives see only the log. MessageBoxIndirectW, which every MessageBox
call reaches, now logs the style, caption and text as an err line
([msgbox]) before it shows the box, and the button it returned after.
Nothing else changes.

Class: diagnostics
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-09-30-d3d12-feature-level-12.md
Offered-upstream: no
---
 dlls/user32/msgbox.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/dlls/user32/msgbox.c b/dlls/user32/msgbox.c
index 009f385..db5e540 100644
--- a/dlls/user32/msgbox.c
+++ b/dlls/user32/msgbox.c
@@ -523,6 +523,12 @@ INT WINAPI MessageBoxIndirectW( LPMSGBOXPARAMSW msgbox )
     UINT i;
     struct ThreadWindows threadWindows;
 
+    /* A game that stops with a message box says why in it; the log keeps it
+     * where no one is looking at the screen. */
+    ERR( "[msgbox] style %#lx caption %s text %s\n", msgbox->dwStyle,
+         IS_INTRESOURCE(msgbox->lpszCaption) ? wine_dbgstr_a( "(resource)" ) : debugstr_w( msgbox->lpszCaption ),
+         IS_INTRESOURCE(msgbox->lpszText) ? wine_dbgstr_a( "(resource)" ) : debugstr_w( msgbox->lpszText ) );
+
     if (!(hRes = FindResourceExW(user32_module, (LPWSTR)RT_DIALOG, L"MSGBOX", msgbox->dwLanguageId)))
     {
         if (!msgbox->dwLanguageId ||
@@ -543,6 +549,7 @@ INT WINAPI MessageBoxIndirectW( LPMSGBOXPARAMSW msgbox )
     NtUserModifyUserStartupInfoFlags( STARTF_USESHOWWINDOW, 0 );
     ret=DialogBoxIndirectParamW(msgbox->hInstance, tmplate,
                                 msgbox->hwndOwner, MSGBOX_DlgProc, (LPARAM)msgbox);
+    ERR( "[msgbox] returned %d\n", ret );
 
     if ((msgbox->dwStyle & MB_TASKMODAL) && (msgbox->hwndOwner==NULL))
     {
